# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, so frozen files hash the
# same on Windows, macOS, Linux, and CI (rule 4).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Predictions files: never touched by git's text handling, so their bytes and
# hashes never change (rule 15, §16).
PREDICTIONS* -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pkl binary
